            // If currentVersion() reverts, then we cannot compare; in reference implementation currentVersion calls oracle().currentVersion()
            // and transforms; to keep the property universal we require currentVersion to succeed. Exclude cases by assuming false
            // but vm.assume is allowed; instead we simply revert the test by asserting false to indicate the precondition failed.
